{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>2019年香港小姐亞軍兼最上鏡小姐王菲，上月獲唱片公司太子爺男友張子丰於湖上驚喜求婚，二人低調拍拖多年終於修成正果。即將升格做人妻的王菲幸福滿瀉，日前她在社交平台分享現身馬場的靚相，身穿黑色吊帶連身裙的她明艷照人，高貴又有氣質！</p><figure><img alt=\"王菲上月獲唱片公司太子爺男友張子丰於湖上驚喜求婚。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172851163440353280063245.jpeg/vNypE7DRQ3b5RTNQzBZRl7s56K3myUxKlpKodJaSqHQ\"/><figcaption>王菲上月獲唱片公司太子爺男友張子丰於湖上驚喜求婚。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"求婚成功！（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172851144582631424695712.jpeg/7TpOQzyZsfFUAxdobJprb6zEjzBGQ2NPbr09w269PcM\"/><figcaption>求婚成功！（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sweet！（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172851141877174272605347.jpeg/isiCbGDHFc5uvxZmhDSw45TEpPPTPh-z2OUdc9jlHXM\"/><figcaption>Sweet！（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恭喜！（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172851160541958144205914.jpeg/bebz9_UmaQuSVfRx5NNkM8DLpcOryVRc4_wl7uP8Je4\"/><figcaption>恭喜！（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><p>準人妻王菲現身馬場打卡　大曬香肩玉背風騷甜笑</p><p>王菲在IG分享於馬場看台拍攝的靚相，相中所見，身穿黑色吊帶裙的她，大騷白滑香肩及玉背，甜笑擺Pose打卡，相當風騷！現年30歲的王菲與張子丰因合作拍攝TVB劇集《法言人》而擦出愛火，二人拍拖多年一直保持低調，未有公開認愛，但早已是圈中公開的秘密。直至上個月初，張子丰特別精心安排於湖中央向女友驚喜求婚，更送上紅玫瑰及巨鑽，獲王菲一口答應，場面浪漫！</p><figure><img alt=\"王菲現身馬場打卡。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188271812648505344036198.jpeg/BtpEhP5_rwDXNK9cufECKgaxjLckDiOZcBlILXAZSC0\"/><figcaption>王菲現身馬場打卡。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"風騷甜笑。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188271809938853888471920.jpeg/ApfZgyuXbsqI9GHdmaZMF3k-11-plwtuMUbHyzFGx8s\"/><figcaption>風騷甜笑。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬香肩玉背。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188271807191453696384602.jpeg/ICBbGcEV_uQeL0o2EO9yDTUwuVDLNs2a81r5NfNa-TU\"/><figcaption>大曬香肩玉背。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬香肩玉背。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188271804288864256956832.jpeg/_z1duaO_GKWax7Kf6ku_3CCeVV-T3p-eztRdVM7UXVQ\"/><figcaption>大曬香肩玉背。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"湖中求婚極浪漫。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172851169375555584573460.jpeg/pQFIQXJPBbHjLA5hjAK2J3sQW3lvIH3x5KyXOeSslzk\"/><figcaption>湖中求婚極浪漫。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"親友見證。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172851166376497152720465.jpeg/_P2yX8sAbZlXOVEPhPQ3dDz6sQNj2Qfb5asJA-WrCQM\"/><figcaption>親友見證。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王菲大曬巨鑽。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260905/1172851157547094016045783.jpeg/JIEpsZ2HypdqPFBX54Qdg3hXeLfs7RVjp-lAG6fpQBs\"/><figcaption>王菲大曬巨鑽。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><p>張子丰背景猛料　 唱片公司太子爺擁過億身家</p><p>張子丰畢業於加拿大名校皇后大學電影系及心理系，其父親為「環星音樂會之父」、身家估計過億的環星娛樂老闆張國林。身為「唱片公司太子爺」的張子丰曾出道做歌手，其後成立製作公司，執導及拍攝過不少微電影與MV。近年張子丰將創立的工作室擴展為音樂廠牌MVP，推出一系列電影主題歌曲，更先後簽下何雁詩、江若琳。早前王菲出席活動接受《香港01》訪問時，甜笑直認與未婚夫非常合拍：「兩個人好夾、相處得好好，我哋一齊好開心，所以先決定步入人生下一階段。」更透露婚禮籌備進度：「一開始我哋諗不如自己定日子，之後買咗本通勝睇，又問下AI，發現每個AI講嘅嘢都唔同，搞到頭都大埋！最後我哋覺得都係唔好搞著自己，都係搵師傅比較好。」並表示目標希望在明年完婚。</p><figure><img alt=\"因合作拍攝TVB劇集《法言人》而擦出愛火。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188276673913556992826395.jpeg/M31IBcbPAJNSiwZNkOVaB-IFKebWRIf4gFZaGIBWWhg\"/><figcaption>因合作拍攝TVB劇集《法言人》而擦出愛火。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"低調拍拖多年。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188276557794512896760234.jpeg/6ZFSdyvwqQyrkUSfaJqEcmeHLRm17jgnQd5T30HeU98\"/><figcaption>低調拍拖多年。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"低調拍拖多年。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188276555160358912402975.jpeg/I4OOUlFwIdd4pLVQrXk8K69kepUwBwls_MwSn_zMEp8\"/><figcaption>低調拍拖多年。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好合拍。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188276552652034048275964.jpeg/1cLcbZZ5Xo8pKJlAuAzDjK89Mv4o_wvDPbSKaT20imk\"/><figcaption>好合拍。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好合拍。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188276676308635648235084.jpeg/EfU5GOp5IhYOkqzGzFEtJEkOEVTkJdMsMQZYaDEGWGg\"/><figcaption>好合拍。（IG@wongfeiiiiii）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:18:48.875673+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1068,"images":16,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:47.203502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:17:35.216714+00:00","content_hash":"2b41365822af4045c998dece9c2287c0c43828d6d1b1c31be3a61bf912478f98","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}